      "estimand": "Difference in mean travel portability (a pre-validated forecast of destination embedded minutes or net rating, computed from source-team play-type profile) between cut-heavy and drive-heavy shaper movers, controlling for prior talent, usage, and age.",
      "unit": "A shaper mover (player who changes teams from one season to the next), where shaper is defined as low-usage, positive residual influence.",
      "sample": "All shaper movers from 2022-23 → 2023-24, 2023-24 → 2024-25, and 2024-25 → 2025-26, using complete regular-season data for source and destination years; n≈24. Exclude rookies and players with fewer than 100 possessions in the source season.",
